Chat service

----------
How to use THE CLIENT:

Connect to the server with the client by running 
./client.py [server IP] [server port].

Commands:
/username [new username]

click cross to exit

----------
(How to use the server)
Start the server by running ./server.py [listen port]. listen port > 1023.
Exit the server with SIGINT. 

